{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_018tMjnkfEu6qAPfJVNSzvQM","type":"tool_result","content":"     1→id: test-rel02.0\n     2→title: \"Test Suite: rel02.0 — trivial utilities (true, false, yes, basename, dirname)\"\n     3→release: rel02.0\n     4→\n     5→traces:\n     6→  - rel02.0-uc001-true\n     7→  - rel02.0-uc002-false\n     8→  - rel02.0-uc003-yes\n     9→  - rel02.0-uc004-basename\n    10→  - rel02.0-uc005-dirname\n    11→  - prd013-true R1\n    12→  - prd013-true R2\n    13→  - prd013-true R3\n    14→  - prd013-true R4\n    15→  - prd014-false R1\n    16→  - prd014-false R2\n    17→  - prd014-false R3\n    18→  - prd014-false R4\n    19→  - prd012-yes R1\n    20→  - prd012-yes R2\n    21→  - prd012-yes R3\n    22→  - prd012-yes R4\n    23→  - prd015-basename R1\n    24→  - prd015-basename R2\n    25→  - prd015-basename R3\n    26→  - prd015-basename R4\n    27→  - prd016-dirname R1\n    28→  - prd016-dirname R2\n    29→  - prd016-dirname R3\n    30→  - prd016-dirname R4\n    31→\n    32→preconditions:\n    33→  - All binaries exist in ./bin/ (built via mage build).\n    34→  - Reference binaries gtrue, gfalse, gyes, gbasename, gdirname are installed via Homebrew (coreutils) and on PATH.\n    35→  - Tests are run via go test ./cmd/<utility>/... which invokes RunDiffTests from pkg/testutils.\n    36→  - All tests use LC_ALL=C to eliminate locale-dependent divergence.\n    37→  - \"yes tests pipe output through 'head -n N' to capture a finite number of lines.\"\n    38→\n    39→test_cases:\n    40→  # --- true ---\n    41→  - name: true_no_args\n    42→    description: Invoke true with no arguments; expect exit 0, no output.\n    43→    inputs:\n    44→      args: []\n    45→      stdin: \"\"\n    46→      env: [\"LC_ALL=C\"]\n    47→    normalization: none\n    48→    expected:\n    49→      exit_code: 0\n    50→      stdout: \"\"\n    51→      stderr: \"\"\n    52→    traces:\n    53→      - prd013-true R1.1\n    54→\n  